# A1-5b — local environment files.
# These hold SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY, SUPABASE_ANON_KEY,
# GOOGLE_TTS_API_KEY, VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY and CRON_SECRET. Committing one
# means rotating all of them, so keep every .env variant out of git.
# .env.example is the documented template and stays tracked.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

# 真實 AI 稽核報告：含作文內容與模型輸出，逐次產生，不進版控
docs/learn/writing-audit/
.preflight/

# ── Six-Way Reading 題庫 ────────────────────────────
# 🛑 題庫內容【絕對不進 Git】：文章全文、正解、解說、以及任何
#    由它們產生的 INSERT SQL。repo 只放 schema / parser / validator / 測試。
#    誤 commit 一次就等於把答案公開，而 git 歷史刪不乾淨。
generated/
*.reading-source.xlsx
supabase/migrations/*_reading_import_data*.sql
